sect2.para:
If a SeedDataPath is configured in
                    appsettings.json, the server loads the seed data
                    from that directory on startup. To reload the seed data at runtime:

Return a different property than the one being searched. For example,
                    return family names of patients whose name matches "smi":
                    /fire/Patient/$autocomplete?name=smi&_autocomplete=family

listitem.para:
A FHIR search parameter with its prefix value, e.g. name=smi,
                                    _id=123. For _id this is an exact match;
                                    for other parameters it is a case-insensitive prefix match.
